/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (While traditional methods like VAEs and GANs have seen success, score-based generative modeling has emerged as a robust paradigm that avoids direct likelihood estimation by learning the score function                    . A key insight that links this theory to practice is that training a denoising autoencoder to reconstruct clean data from Gaussian noise implicitly estimates the score of the data distribution. Hence, the generative process in DDPMs can be viewed as a specific parameterisation of Annealed Langevin Dynamics. Besides this, DDPMs can also be expressed using several equivalent objectives [1].)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
